          "type": "number",
          "label": "x₁ =",
          "answer": -3,
          "tolerance": 0.1
        },
        {
          "id": "q3_x2",
          "type": "number",
          "label": "x₂ =",
          "answer": 5,
          "tolerance": 0.1
        }
      ],
      "plus_minus": true,
      "hint": "Set f(x)=0. |x-1| = 4 gives two answers.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Parent: y = |x| (absolute value : V shape).",
        "Transformations: right 1, reflect over x-axis, up 4.",
        "x-intercepts: 0 = -|x-1| + 4 → |x-1| = 4.",
        "x - 1 = 4 → x = 5, or x - 1 = -4 → x = -3."
      ],
      "feedback_correct": "🔥 Absolute value. Both intercepts.",
      "feedback_wrong_parent": "The | | symbols mean absolute value.",
      "feedback_wrong": "|x-1|=4. Two cases: x=5 or x=-3."
    },
    {
