      "hint": "Isolate the √, then square both sides.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "√(5x-1) = 5.",
        "Square both sides: 5x - 1 = 25.",
        "5x = 26 → x = 26/5 = 5.2.",
        "Check: √(26-1) + 2 = √25 + 2 = 5 + 2 = 7 ✓"
